      "display_title": "Issue #6: Create Banner with Tablet Device for Publishing GoThru 360 Viewer",
      "main_description_html": "<ul>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"/>\nApp Store</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"/>\nPlay Store</li>\n</ul>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Shot #</th><th>Screen</th><th>What to show</th><th>Tips</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Hero — Little Planet</strong></td><td>Full-screen Little Planet projection</td><td>Use the test panorama. Make sure the sphere is centered and visually striking. Hide the UI controls (tap to toggle).</td></tr>\n<tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Three projections</strong></td><td>Normal / Little Planet / Fisheye of the same panorama</td><td>Show all 3 modes — either side-by-side in a composite or as a 3-screenshot sequence.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Gallery</strong></td><td>Dated grid of panorama thumbnails</td><td>Populate the device with several good panoramas so the grid looks full. GoThru logo should be visible in the header.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Capture</strong></td><td>AR target grid mid-shoot</td><td>Start a capture session, complete a few orange dots, then screenshot mid-shoot so the guidance grid is visible.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>5</td><td><strong>Map</strong></td><td>Map view with panorama pins</td><td>Make sure several panoramas have GPS data so pins appear on the map. Zoom to a cluster.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>6</td><td><strong>Send to Friend</strong></td><td>QR code pairing or transfer progress</td><td>Open Send to Friend on the sending device, screenshot the QR code screen.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr />\n<h2>RESULT</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29288240/GoThru-hero-banner.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GoThru-hero-banner.zip</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29288459/GoThru-ipadpro-05-share.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GoThru-ipadpro-05-share.zip</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29288470/GoThru-ipadpro-01-viewer.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GoThru-ipadpro-01-viewer.zip</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29288117/tablet-10.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">tablet-10.zip</a></p>\n<img width=\"2400\" height=\"1350\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"assets/image-a2c7e7b4-4ea2-4fb2-947c-10fd168a6e55.png\" />\n<h2>ipad-pro-12.9</h2>\n<img width=\"2048\" height=\"2732\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"assets/image-011cf445-2958-4ef9-815b-52a1e4de17f4.png\" />\n<img width=\"2048\" height=\"2732\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"assets/image-c8d20694-a462-42ca-befc-830b2e5ca335.png\" />\n<img width=\"2048\" height=\"2732\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"assets/image-9eb8c130-d37e-4d02-8924-932cfb3a9da1.png\" />\n<img width=\"2048\" height=\"2732\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"assets/image-9530db22-5e4a-424d-8f16-f4ec56275155.png\" />\n<img width=\"2048\" height=\"2732\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"assets/image-bc35719a-f859-4ff0-b76f-0f5ba9ae1004.png\" />\n<img width=\"2048\" height=\"2732\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"assets/image-3aa406a7-d812-4b74-9996-c3725bb01241.png\" />\n<hr />\n<h2>tablet-10</h2>\n<img width=\"1600\" height=\"2560\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"assets/image-28f3b33c-94e0-4eff-8c21-9719b32dd142.png\" />\n<img width=\"1600\" height=\"2560\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"assets/image-edbd399f-1cd0-4f4e-be40-295e9bb65a19.png\" />\n<img width=\"1600\" height=\"2560\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"assets/image-0fc58594-8a8e-43c1-85a7-11f6b595853f.png\" />\n<img width=\"1600\" height=\"2560\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"assets/image-c94b756c-895f-43f7-9cc2-1db1ee68715a.png\" />\n<img width=\"1600\" height=\"2560\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"assets/image-c0f69063-5fbf-4b26-9169-8809b73df5b9.png\" />\n<img width=\"1600\" height=\"2560\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"assets/image-8df3a558-df12-436e-a344-dfb73c16d404.png\" />\n",
